      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是吗？那就好……。/n对了，刚才说到哪了？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我有个同事要被裁掉了……经济不景气，也没办法。/n拿不出成果的人，最后就只能被淘汰。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（拿不出成果的人……就会被迫离开……）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080070",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 25,
          "SpineId": 20501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "时雨，你筷子都停下来了。/n果然还是不舒服吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "没、没事……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080090",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 73,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 20501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……也许不该在吃饭的时候聊这种话。/n不过，时雨你也最好认真听着。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080100",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "早点理解社会有多么严酷很重要。/n尤其你现在还处在比较特殊的环境里。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯，也是……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 20501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "没能积累成果和信用的人，/n等到后来才发现自己失败了，也已经晚了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "自己的未来要好好想清楚。/n行动得越快，才越容易换来结果。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "毕竟浪费掉的时间，再也回不来了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "就是这个道理。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "时雨你现在可能还处在能单纯享受演戏的阶段，/n但以后也要认真考虑自己的将来。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯、嗯……。/n我当然明白，爸爸。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080180",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 400,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 20501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的父亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊，说到戏剧……人事部的人午休时好像聊过。/n听说最近有什么大型戏剧活动之类的。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啊。你说的是“星象季”吧。/n我周围也有人在聊。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080210",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 500,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "SpineId": 20501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "205"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨的母亲",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "具体的我也不太清楚，不过好像是为了发掘有潜力的演员，/n会有人从海外来日本的剧团视察，对吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1020408023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯、嗯。好像是。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10204080230",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "HeadMotionMasterId": 1,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 20501,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
