      "EpisodeMasterId": 1020408,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "时雨",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（爸爸……Eden早就不是什么“随便的剧团”了。/n　我们得到过机会……可是……）",
